vectorwake sim core (sim/): C99 fixed-point 100Hz with flight, energy, bullets/bombs, damage/death/respawn, events, golden-trace determinism harness on x86-64/arm64/wasm; code uses generic terms (baseline/units), no inherited jargon.                                                      
vectorwake playable web client (bare-clang wasm, one 43KB HTML, AI pilots through the input path); make lesson: command-line CFLAGS replaces makefile CFLAGS += entirely, so required flags live in a separate BASE var.                                                                       
